{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54146","headline":"再游云门访僧不遇 · 薛能","name":"再游云门访僧不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数歇渡深水，渐非尘俗间。\n泉声入秋寺，月色徧寒山。\n石路几回雪，禅房又闭关。\n不知双树客，何处与云闲。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷六）（按：《全唐诗》卷五九五收作于武陵诗，题作《夜寻僧不遇》。\n当以薛作爲是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}